    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script steps the Schnakenberg PDE and the classical k_c formula, and the pattern-band eigenmodes track the discrete dispersion relation (r=0.999). Parameters are reconstructed to hit 3.125 µm; they are not a published trilobite kinetic table. Pass 1 does not yet score a 2D patch." ;
