<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 3.125 µm for Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (Pass 1) — MorphoEval overall 82.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 integrates a near-onset Schnakenberg system whose classical k_c is 2π/3.125 µm. Eigenmode growth on the pattern-forming band matches the discrete dispersion relation at Pearson r = 0.99937, RMSE = 0.0271 /s. Equal diffusion gives σ_max = -0.458 /s. A diffusion-ratio sweep moves λ_max from 3.146 µm to 3.993 µm. The vendored dorsal photograph yields 11 axial furrows against the assigned meraspid count of 12, circularity 0.191, coherency 0.613. The GIF (720×560, 13 frames at this pass) ends on that photograph (CV similarity 95.7). k_c is held fixed into the holaspis18 successor; the trunk segment surplus is 6. Overall 82.9/100 (faithfulness 81.4, reproducibility 86.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 84, Morphological realism / specimen match 78, Parameter expressivity 84, Morphometric validation 82, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 82, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 473511 B, 1500×1080 px, artifact_sha256 359856907d3dc0849ccbc92ca7768f40e0ce881f7ba4bb2da5f64a3518951f79 (sha256 359856907d3dc0849ccbc92ca7768f40e0ce881f7ba4bb2da5f64a3518951f79), spec_fingerprint a620df60d6c5b5e97ca4ce3d5911512c60ca0cb80af273a47beb27e51cc495ce. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a620df60d6c5b5e97ca4ce3d5911512c60ca0cb80af273a47beb27e51cc495ce; artifact_sha256: 359856907d3dc0849ccbc92ca7768f40e0ce881f7ba4bb2da5f64a3518951f79; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=61b94136e918acb9..., datasets/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=50ac5dbca8261978...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Meraspid Aulacopleura adds thoracic segments; holaspid number varies (Fusco et al. 2004; Hughes & Chapman 1995). | Turing 1952 selects an intrinsic chemical wavelength; Schnakenberg 1979 supplies the two-species kinetics.; reconstructed_in_script: a=0.0625, b=0.875, D_u=2e-12 m^2/s, D_v/D_u = 1.02 × r_crit, and γ are solved so λ_c = 3.125 µm. | The M12 to holaspis18 change at this scale is the segment surplus 6 at fixed k_c.; transfer_boundary: Murray 1981 is used only as the scale argument that domain length, not k_c, changes the number of hosted wavelengths.; does_not_claim: That 3.125 µm was measured on the photograph. | That the dorsal photograph is a verified degree-12 meraspis (counted furrows are 11). | That a Turing mechanism operated in the Silurian animal.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add a 2D pleural-patch integration and report its dominant anteroposterior wavenumber against k_c. The Pass-1 law is a 1D transect.",
        "remediation needed: Draw the specimen segmentation contour on the comparison figure. The mask is computed but not shown.",
        "remediation needed: Print the KS statistic of the dispersion residuals on the dispersion panel.",
        "remediation needed: State the M12 to holaspis18 copy-ratio (18/12) on the sweep panel, not only the segment surplus." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.29e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 3.125 µm for Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (Pass 1) — Parameter expressivity: 84/100" ;
